  "scope": "Generic dynamic MaxHP: stored HP ratio, live stat reads, stat-mod add/replace/remove/expiry and absolute HPDebt semantics. Source audit only; character/weapon-specific MaxHP providers and synchronous OnHPDebt callbacks changing MaxHP during healing remain unmapped.",
